    "identifier": "akimichi-ballistic-element-wheel",
    "description": "<p>An Akimichi secret maneuver allowing you to take a nature release you are encountering or clashing with, and turning it against your foes.</p>\n<p>When the triggering Akimichi Hijutsu would allow you to make a melee attack against a hostile creature under the effects of, or clash with, a jutsu with a nature release keyword. Make a Contested Strength or Constitution ability check, vs the targets Jutsu save DC. On a success, you Dispel their jutsu’s effects. If they are under the effects of two or more jutsu with a nature release keyword, dispel the oldest, or highest rank one, otherwise, choose at random.</p>\n<p>Expansion Crash. Add your proficiency bonus to the contested check.</p>",
